#: ../../../source/Capabilities/Simulation/URDF/Using-URDF-with-Robot-State-Publisher-cpp.rst:19
msgid ""
"URDF models describe robot structure and joint relationships for simulation "
"and visualisation. This article shows how to create a C++ package that "
"publishes joint states and uses robot_state_publisher with a URDF model. "
"After following these steps, you can launch a walking robot simulation and "
"view it in Rviz."
msgstr ""

